    "long_instructions": "## Create Your First Object\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Use your warm-up list to write a prompt in `prompt.md` asking AI to create a JavaScript object.\r\n2. Send your prompt to AI Tutor to generate your object in `script.js`.\r\n3. Make one change:\r\n   - update a value, or\r\n   - add a new property  \r\n\r\n### Check Your Code:\r\n- How many properties are in your object?  \r\n- Do the property names match what you planned?  \r\n- Where are the values stored?  ",
